TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}! Burada DEVASA bir olay!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Ay çıkar çıkmaz şenlik başlıyor!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Aşırı heyecanlıyım!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Are you staying here until tonight?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Please check out the full moon in
our town if you have the time!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Moon watching is always more fun
when there are more people around,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bleibst du bis heute Abend hier?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Unseren Vollmond darfst du dir
auf keinen Fall entgehen lassen!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}macht mir am allermeisten
Spaß, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}wenn viele Leute mitfeiern,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Yeter artık, gerçek yüzünü göster! Böyle
bir dolunay gecesinde kasabamıza gelmen{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sen aslında Ay'dan gelen uzaylısın, değil mi?!{{TAG:0008:0005:0E0015000F002800}}
Evet!
Hayır!

{{TAG:0003:000D:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Vay be! Biliyordum! Ay'dan geldiğini
biliyordum!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bir dakika? Eve nasıl döneceksin?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0013:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dostum, şimdi sana üzülmeye başladım{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Pero...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Oye, ¿lo dices en serio?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¿Y cómo puedo saber que dices
la verdad, campe{{TAG:000E:0006:0400F3006E0006006F006E006100}} lunar?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Heh heh! I'm proud of my town!
I guess this is the best spot to
observe the moon as well, huh?{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja! ¡Estoy orgulloso de mi
pueblo! ¡Desde aquí se ve la luna
mejor que en ningún sitio!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ha ha ! J'en étais sûr ! Cette ville
est un vrai petit paradis, normal que
la lune y soit plus jolie !{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Heh heh! Kasabamla gurur duyuyorum!
Demek Ay'ı seyretmek için de en iyi yer
burası, ha?{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

{{TAG:0003:0012:}}İkisi de aynı mı? {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Eh, evet, anlıyorum ama{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Manzara ya da Ay'a bakarken hissettirdiği
şey gibi mutlaka farklar vardır!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
Galiba bunları fark etmek için gerçekten
olgun biri olmak lazım, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
